3)Modify the range of leaf:/bfd:state/bfd:bfd/bfd:session-results/bfd:session-result/slice-id;
4)Modify the range of leaf:/bfd:notification-bfd-sessions/bfd:bfd-sessions/bfd:bfd-session/slice-id;' ;
  }

